{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/231631-black-dog-game-factory","id":231631,"title":"Black Dog Game Factory","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-17T10:19:18-07:00","id":231631,"title":"Black Dog Game Factory","content":"Black Dog Game Factory if those who remember was a off shoot for White Wolf for more adult theme materials (not just sexual but graphic things as well). I just wondered if this label would be coming back under the Onyx Path publishing umbrella?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T14:33:26-07:00","id":231960,"title":"","content":"Black dog was kind of a joke. I doubt it comes back. There were like 3 or 4 books by them total iirc","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T15:01:39-07:00","id":232001,"title":"","content":"Black Dog was always just an imprint. It actually had 13 WOD books, a WOD novella, and the two HOL books.<br /> <br /> But in general, WW and OP seem to have no interest in it being a thing outside of the fictional company in WtA.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T15:10:17-07:00","id":232005,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/231631-black-dog-game-factory?p=231960#post231960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Black dog was kind of a joke. I doubt it comes back. There were like 3 or 4 books by them total iirc</div> </div> </div> </div>Of which that very touchy issues were covered. From the Holocaust onwards.<br /> <br /> Granted, the &quot;THINK OF TEH CHILLIANS!&quot; crowd has gone to complain about other things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T23:39:38-07:00","id":232512,"title":"","content":"I thought Black Dog was a good way to make it very clear at the time of purchase that something was going to contain really adult themes and writing that might make people uncomfortable. I imagine though that Black Dog books also tended to sell a little less well than more traditional White Wolf books, so it would be understandable if Onyx Path didn't want to bring the imprint back.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/231631-black-dog-game-factory?p=231960#post231960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Black dog was kind of a joke. I doubt it comes back. There were like 3 or 4 books by them total iirc</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, the Shoah book definitely wasn't a joke. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-18T01:31:18-07:00","id":232607,"title":"","content":"Is it weird that I still want to read Eternal Hearts, despite knowing what the basic plot is, along with the &quot;shock factor&quot; moments?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T15:24:47-07:00","id":244369,"title":"","content":"To be fair, Black Dog is now no longer necessary since Onyx Path only distributes books digitally. Back in the 90's, White Wolf sold things in brick and mortar stores, and even had some mainstream distributors (such as Barnes &amp; Noble, Borders, and even Wal-Mart at one point) and the Black Dog imprint was needed to let publishers know the books were graphic, so if a kid bought something like Freak Legion, their mommy wouldn't sue the store for selling it.<br /> <br /> Plus, while the anti-RPG backlash was dying down in the 90's, it still had a few supporters here and there as late as 1996 following a certain incident in Florida where VTM came under unnecessary scrutiny for something it had nothing to do with. So things like Black Dog were needed so White Wolf could cover their own ass (though Black Dog predated the incident).<br /> <br /> Now, there is no anti-RPG movement like there was in the 80s and 90s, and Onyx Path distributes digitally, so Black Dog is no longer needed. I'm sure Onyx Path could publish an 18+ supplement book, and get by with just a warning label and an age check and not need a whole separate imprint.<br /> <br /> But Black Dog did have some of the best books, including my favorites Destiny's Price and Montreal By Night.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T09:19:21-07:00","id":244842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> To be fair, the Shoah book definitely wasn't a joke. </div> </div> </div>When they presented plot hook with Anielewicz's Wraith as potential antagonist I wanted to punch whomever wrote that passage since it was too offensive even for early White Wolf standards.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}